(Typical Request Flow: Add Product To Cart) Tj
T*
(1. User logs in through AuthController.) Tj
T*
(2. Server creates JWT cookie.) Tj
T*
(3. User calls cart API.) Tj
T*
(4. AuthTokenFilter validates JWT.) Tj
T*
(5. Controller receives request.) Tj
T*
(6. Controller calls CartService.) Tj
T*
(7. Service gets product/user/cart from repositories.) Tj
T*
(8. Service updates cart item and total price.) Tj
T*
(9. Repository saves data in MySQL.) Tj
T*
(10. Controller returns CartDTO.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
