T*
(Controller layer: handles HTTP requests) Tj
T*
(Service layer: business logic) Tj
T*
(Repository layer: database operations) Tj
T*
(Model layer: JPA entities) Tj
T*
(Payload layer: DTOs) Tj
T*
(Security layer: authentication and authorization) Tj
T*
(Exception layer: centralized error handling) Tj
T*
(Config layer: beans, constants, security setup) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Best Interview Explanation) Tj
T*
(My project is a Spring Boot based e-commerce REST API. I used Spring Web for) Tj
T*
(APIs, Spring Data JPA for database operations, MySQL as the database, Spring) Tj
T*
(Security with JWT cookies for authentication, and role-based authorization for) Tj
T*
(admin routes. The project follows layered architecture where controllers) Tj
T*
(handle requests, services contain business logic, repositories interact with) Tj
